sequenceDiagram
    actor E as Employe
    participant FE as Interface Employe
    participant S as Serveur Laravel
    participant BD as Base de Donnees
    actor A as Admin
    E->>FE: Remplir formulaire de conge
    FE->>S: POST /employee/leave-requests
    S->>BD: INSERT leave_request (status=pending)
    BD-->>S: Demande creee
    S-->>FE: Confirmation envoi
    FE-->>E: Demande soumise
    A->>S: GET /admin/leave-requests
    S->>BD: SELECT leave_requests (status=pending)
    BD-->>S: Liste des demandes
    S-->>A: Afficher demandes en attente
    alt Approuver
        A->>S: PUT /admin/leave-requests/approve
        S->>BD: UPDATE leave_request (status=approved)
        S->>BD: INSERT notification employe
        S-->>A: Demande approuvee
    else Rejeter
        A->>S: PUT /admin/leave-requests/reject
        S->>BD: UPDATE leave_request (status=rejected)
        S->>BD: INSERT notification employe
        S-->>A: Demande rejetee
    end
    E->>FE: Consulter notifications
    FE->>S: GET /employee/notifications
    S->>BD: SELECT notifications non lues
    BD-->>S: Notification conge
    S-->>FE: Afficher resultat
    FE-->>E: Decision affichee
